IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PRICES-TEST.

*> 這份檢查器不需要修改，是這一題的驗收標準。
*> 它會依序執行學生寫的段落，再檢查結果。

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  CK-TOTAL     PIC S9(6)V99.
01  CK-MAX       PIC S9(4)V99.
01  CK-MAXPOS    PIC 99.
01  CK-ACTUAL    PIC X(40).

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
COBLINGS-TEST-MAIN.
    PERFORM LOAD-PRICES
    PERFORM SUM-PRICES
    MOVE WS-TOTAL TO CK-TOTAL
    CALL "COBLINGS-EXPECT-EQUALS"
        USING BY CONTENT "SUM-PRICES 算出的總和（5 筆都要算）"
              BY CONTENT 73.34
              BY CONTENT CK-TOTAL

    PERFORM FIND-MAX
    MOVE WS-MAX-PRICE TO CK-MAX
    CALL "COBLINGS-EXPECT-EQUALS"
        USING BY CONTENT "FIND-MAX 找到的最高單價"
              BY CONTENT 30.00
              BY CONTENT CK-MAX
    MOVE WS-MAX-POS TO CK-MAXPOS
    CALL "COBLINGS-EXPECT-EQUALS"
        USING BY CONTENT "最高單價所在的下標"
              BY CONTENT 3
              BY CONTENT CK-MAXPOS

*> 表格要能用下標正確讀寫每一筆
    MOVE SPACES TO CK-ACTUAL
    MOVE WS-CODE (4) TO CK-ACTUAL
    CALL "COBLINGS-EXPECT-EQUALS"
        USING BY CONTENT "第 4 筆的貨號"
              BY CONTENT "D04    "
              BY CONTENT CK-ACTUAL

    PERFORM SHOW-TABLE

    CALL "COBLINGS-DONE"
    GOBACK.
